nting time still needs checking.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"I have not mastered cultivation or selected a qualifying site; establishment is not guaranteed.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Learn cultivation, then assess whether a small planting trial is feasible without compromising food security.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[],\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Personal mastery, suitable spacing and soil, and an eligible food unit.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Study cultivation and reassess after learning completes.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Could broaden future food options; no planting benefit has yet been observed.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","logprobs":[]}

